  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase5Description",
   "szText": "The head admitted to us that Ouna hoped to save her friends—the heads of the Tree—from their fate to hang from its branches forever. Is such a thing even possible?",
   "hLabel": 3388789226
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback4Header",
   "szText": "Speak with Gelena",
   "hLabel": 3097634794
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase11Description",
   "szText": "Gelena and I have found the location of Ouna's hideout. Hopefully, she—and the heads she stole away with—are near.",
   "hLabel": 1641010231
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback44Header",
   "szText": "Survive the Headrotten attack",
   "hLabel": 827916094
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase14Description",
   "szText": "We found a head of the Tree singing a forlorn song in Ouna's den. But where is Ouna?",
   "hLabel": 4104776794
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback13Header",
